<title>USA: Queens County Bancorp raises div to $0.20.</title>
<headline>Queens County Bancorp raises div to $0.20.</headline>
<dateline>FLUSHING, N.Y. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queens County Bancorp Inc said Wednesday it had raised its quarterly dividend to $0.20 per share on shares outstanding after a recent three-for-two stock split.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable May 15, record on May 1.</p>
<p>The company said the new dividend represents a 20 percent increase over its previous dividend rate.</p>
